#: searchproviderdlg.cpp:127
msgid ""
"The Shortcut URL does not contain a \\{...} placeholder for the user query.\n"
"This means that the same page is always going to be visited, regardless of "
"the text typed in with the shortcut."
msgstr ""
"I gna pont d' secwince \\{...} pol cweraedje di l' uzeu e rascourti d' URL.\n"
"Ça fwait ki l' minme pådje serè todi vizitêye, tolminme ké tecse k' on taprè "
"avou l' rascourti."

#: searchproviderdlg.cpp:130
msgid "Keep It"
msgstr "El wårder"

